-- statement:
--   Explicit finite tables of 323 repeated-main-coordinate charts and 88 distinct-main-coordinate charts. Each chart records its three coordinate permutations and Boolean signs. These tables make no assertion that the charts are exhaustive or feasible; those properties are separate proof obligations.
-- source:
--   Sharp diagonal Hlawka campaign: https://prove2.me/campaigns/sharp-diagonal-hlawka-constant .

